","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af676d4f4429d1fd72f78bf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537172565,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:52","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af676cff4429d1fd72f78b5","chatId":"151b9c7eab9a4982a4bae79f1fcf1ac6","sessionId":null,"userId":99854,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“丢人”这个词挺重的。你好像把女儿迟到这件事，直接算成了“我不是个好妈妈”，还拿去跟别人比。\n\n这种觉得自己不如别人的感觉，平时也会在别的时候冒出来吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“丢人”这个词挺重的。你好像把女儿迟到这件事，直接算成了“我不是个好妈妈”，还拿去跟别人比。\n\n这种觉得自己不如别人的感觉，平时也会在别的时候冒出来吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2746,"promptTokens":2119,"completionTokens":201,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:47"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02296715814035258,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af676cff4429d1fd72f78b4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794537167840,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:32:47","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af676cff4429d1fd72f78b4","chatId":"151b9c7eab9a4982a4bae79f1fcf1ac6","sessionId":null,"userId":99854,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就是……觉得自己特别没用。好像别人当妈都当得挺好，就我连送孩子上学都弄不好。唉，这话说出来都觉得丢人。<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptCont